Title: The last Signal
Genre: Sci-Fi

FADE IN:

ACT I

SCENE 1

INT. RESEARCH LAB - NIGHT


A bank of monitors flickers as the building falls unusually quiet.

The readings begin changing faster than anyone can explain.

ARIF

(Curious)
I knew this day would come.

UNIT 7

(Literal-minded)
That is not what the data says.

LINA

(Brave)
Then we do this together.

CUT TO:

ACT I

SCENE 2

INT. UNDERGROUND TUNNEL - NIGHT


Emergency lights lead into darkness where footsteps seem to move on their own.

The readings begin changing faster than anyone can explain.

MARA

(Reckless)
